<tr style="background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Net income (loss) attributable to Comstock Inc.</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0px 0px 1px; margin: 0px;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">(<ix:nonFraction id="c147082315" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_EquityMethodInvestmentNonconsolidatedInvesteeAxis-EquityMethodInvestmentNonconsolidatedInvesteeOrGroupOfInvesteesMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF" sign="-">288,560</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">)</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0px 0px 1px; margin: 0px;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ix:nonFraction id="c147082316" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_EquityMethodInvestmentNonconsolidatedInvesteeAxis-EquityMethodInvestmentNonconsolidatedInvesteeOrGroupOfInvesteesMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">17,438</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   </ix:nonNumeric>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><i style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">Investment in Sierra Springs Opportunity Fund Inc. (&#8220;SSOF&#8221;)&#160;</i></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">From <em style="font: inherit;">2019</em> through&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>,&#160;the Company invested $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082169" contextRef="d_2019-01-01_2025-12-31_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireInvestments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">8,500,000</ix:nonFraction> for <ix:nonFraction id="c147082170" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedBalanceShares" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">11,236,111</ix:nonFraction> shares in SSOF resulting in equity ownership of <ix:nonFraction id="c147082172" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByNoncontrollingOwners" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="4">16.99</ix:nonFraction>% as of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025.&#160;</em>The <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>carrying value of the Company's investment in SSOF reflects an observable transaction adjustment recorded by the Company in <em style="font: inherit;">2023.</em> On <em style="font: inherit;"> October 1, 2025, </em>the Company began accounting for the investment in SSOF using the equity method.&#160;For the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em>-months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>,&#160;the&#160;Company recognized $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082177" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">12,716</ix:nonFraction>&#160;and $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082178" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">240,560</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, in equity loss from affiliates for our investment in SSOF.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">At <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025, </em>the Company had an advance to SSOF of $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082180" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfDebt" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">9,400,000</ix:nonFraction>. During the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em>-months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> March 31, 2026,&#160;</em>the Company advanced an additional $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082182" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-03-31_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfDebt" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">5,750,000</ix:nonFraction>. On <em style="font: inherit;"> March 26, 2026, </em>all advances, totaling $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082184" contextRef="d_2026-03-26_2026-03-26_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">15,150,000</ix:nonFraction> were&#160;converted into&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c147082185" contextRef="d_2026-03-26_2026-03-26_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">23,307,692</ix:nonFraction> shares of SSOF common stock at $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082186" contextRef="d_2026-03-26_2026-03-26_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="lode:DebtConversionConversionRatePricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.65</ix:nonFraction> per share.&#160;On <em style="font: inherit;"> April 30, 2026, </em>the Company converted accrued interest from advances of $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082188" contextRef="d_2026-04-30_2026-04-30_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">237,415</ix:nonFraction>&#160;to <ix:nonFraction id="c147082189" contextRef="d_2026-04-30_2026-04-30_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">365,255</ix:nonFraction>&#160;additional shares of SSOF common stock at $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082190" contextRef="d_2026-04-30_2026-04-30_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="lode:DebtConversionConversionRatePricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.65</ix:nonFraction> per share <span style="color:#000000">(see Note <em style="font: inherit;">4</em>).&#160;</span>As of <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, the Company subscribed to and invested an additional $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082193" contextRef="d_2026-06-30_2026-06-30_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">13,640,000</ix:nonFraction> for <ix:nonFraction id="c147082194" contextRef="d_2026-06-30_2026-06-30_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">20,984,615</ix:nonFraction> additional shares of SSOF common stock at $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082196" contextRef="d_2026-06-30_2026-06-30_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="lode:DebtConversionConversionRatePricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.65</ix:nonFraction> per share.&#160;At&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>&#160;and <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>, the Company owns <ix:nonFraction id="c147082197" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedBalanceShares" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">55,893,673</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction id="c147082198" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedBalanceShares" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">11,236,111</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, in SSOF shares of common stock, representing an ownership of <ix:nonFraction id="c147082200" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByNoncontrollingOwners" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="4">47.63</ix:nonFraction>%&#160;and <ix:nonFraction id="c147082201" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_OwnershipAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncSSOFMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByNoncontrollingOwners" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="4">16.99</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively.&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:exclude>
    <div class="PGFTR" style="text-align: center; width: 100%">
     <div class="hf-row">
      <div class="hf-cell PGNUM" style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman;">
       <em style="font: inherit;">12</em>
      </div>
     </div>
    </div>
    <hr style="PAGE-BREAK-AFTER: always; border: none; width: 100%; height: 2px; color: #000000; background-color: #000000"/>
    <div class="PGHDR" style="text-align: left; width: 100%">
     <div class="hf-row">
      <div class="hf-cell TOCLink" style="display: inline-block; text-align: left;">
       <a href="#toc" style="font-weight: initial; font-style: initial; font-variant: initial; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt;">Table of Contents</a>
