   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><i>Advances to Sierra Springs Opportunity Fund, Inc.&#160;</i></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">At <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025, </em>the Company had advances to SSOF of $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082318" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncNoteReceivableMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:PaymentsForAdvanceToAffiliate" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">9,400,000</ix:nonFraction>. During the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em>-months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> March 31, 2026,&#160;</em>the Company advanced an additional $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082320" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-03-31_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncNoteReceivableMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:PaymentsForAdvanceToAffiliate" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">5,750,000</ix:nonFraction>. On <em style="font: inherit;"> March 26, 2026, </em>all advances, totaling $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082321" contextRef="d_2026-03-26_2026-03-26_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">15,150,000</ix:nonFraction> were contributed in exchange for <ix:nonFraction id="c147082322" contextRef="d_2026-03-26_2026-03-26_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">23,307,692</ix:nonFraction> shares of SSOF common stock at $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082323" contextRef="d_2026-03-26_2026-03-26_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="lode:DebtConversionConversionRatePricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.65</ix:nonFraction> per share (see Note <em style="font: inherit;">3</em>). The advances were unsecured&#160;and bore interest at <ix:nonFraction id="c147082326" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncNoteReceivableMember" unitRef="Pure" name="lode:NoteReceivableInterestRate" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">4.5</ix:nonFraction>%. On <em style="font: inherit;"> April 30, 2026, </em>the Company converted accrued interest from advances of $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082327" contextRef="d_2026-04-30_2026-04-30_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="USD" name="lode:DebtConversionAccruedInterestAmount" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">237,415</ix:nonFraction>&#160;to <ix:nonFraction id="c147082329" contextRef="d_2026-04-30_2026-04-30_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">365,255</ix:nonFraction>&#160;additional shares of SSOF common stock at $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082330" contextRef="d_2026-04-30_2026-04-30_DebtConversionByUniqueDescriptionAxis-ConversionOfSierraSpringsAdvancesIntoSierraSpringsCommonStockMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="lode:DebtConversionConversionRatePricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.65</ix:nonFraction> per share (see Note <em style="font: inherit;">3</em>). There&#160;were <ix:nonFraction id="c147082332" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-SierraSpringsOpportunityFundIncNoteReceivableMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:InterestReceivableCurrent" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="-3">no</ix:nonFraction> advances outstanding at&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><i>Daney Ranch&#160;</i></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">On <em style="font: inherit;"> August 19, 2022, </em>the Company sold the Daney Ranch and issued a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2022-08-19_2022-08-19_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-DaneyRanchSaleNoteReceivableMember" name="lode:NoteReceivableTerm" id="c147082333" format="ixt-sec:duryear">10</ix:nonNumeric>-year $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082334" contextRef="i_2022-08-19_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-DaneyRanchSaleNoteReceivableMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:NotesReceivableGross" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">993,000</ix:nonFraction> note receivable maturing in <em style="font: inherit;"> August 2032 </em>to the former lessee and purchaser. The note bore interest at <ix:nonFraction id="c147082335" contextRef="i_2022-08-19_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-DaneyRanchSaleNoteReceivableMember" unitRef="Pure" name="lode:NoteReceivableInterestRateYearOne" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">2</ix:nonFraction>% for the <em style="font: inherit;">first</em> <em style="font: inherit;">twelve</em> months and bore&#160;interest at <ix:nonFraction id="c147082338" contextRef="i_2022-08-19_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-DaneyRanchSaleNoteReceivableMember" unitRef="Pure" name="lode:NoteReceivableInterestRateThereafter" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">7</ix:nonFraction>% per annum for the remaining term. The note is secured by a <em style="font: inherit;">second</em> priority security interest in the property. On <em style="font: inherit;"> June 25, 2026, </em>the Company and a <em style="font: inherit;">third</em>-party entered into a promissory note purchase agreement in which the Company sold the Daney Ranch note receivable for cash consideration of $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082341" contextRef="d_2026-06-25_2026-06-25" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfNotesReceivable" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">500,000</ix:nonFraction>. Since the cash consideration received of $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082342" contextRef="d_2026-06-25_2026-06-25" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfNotesReceivable" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">500,000</ix:nonFraction> was less than the carrying value of the note,<span style="color:#000000">&#160;the&#160;Company recorded a loss on sale of note&#160;receivable of $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082343" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:GainLossOnSaleOfNotesReceivable" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF" sign="-">403,217</ix:nonFraction>&#160;for the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em>-months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>.</span></p>
  </ix:nonNumeric>
  <div>
    &#160;
  </div>
  <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentDisclosureTextBlock" id="c3222867" escape="true">
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>NOTE <em style="font: inherit;">5</em></b>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<b>PROPERTIES, PLANT AND EQUIPMENT, NET AND MINERAL RIGHTS </b></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Properties, plant and equipment at <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em> and&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em> include the following:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock" id="c3222868" escape="true">
    <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="finTable" style="width: 100%; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-indent: 0px;"><tbody><tr class="finHeading" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 1px;">&#160;</td><td colspan="2" style="text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;">June 30, 2026</em></b></p> </td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 1px;">&#160;</td><td colspan="2" style="text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;">December 31, 2025</em></b></p> </td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td></tr>
