   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">All intangible assets and goodwill are associated with our Bioleum (Fuels Segment).&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">During the <em style="font: inherit;">second</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2026,</em> the Company concluded that its plans for advanced lignocellulosic biomass and other decarbonizing solutions <em style="font: inherit;">no</em> longer considered the use of the Flux Photon and Fenix developed technologies relevant or effective, acquired in <em style="font: inherit;">2021</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">2025.</em> As a result, the Company determined that the carrying amount of the related developed technology intangible assets was <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> recoverable and recorded an impairment loss of $<ix:nonFraction id="c147082495" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:GoodwillAndIntangibleAssetImpairment" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">13,648,042</ix:nonFraction>, representing the full net carrying value of those assets, in its Bioleum (Fuels Segment). The impairment is presented as loss on intangible asset impairment in the condensed consolidated statements of operations.</p>
  </ix:nonNumeric>
  <div>
    &#160;
  </div>
  <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:AccountsPayableAccruedLiabilitiesAndOtherLiabilitiesDisclosureCurrentTextBlock" id="c3222878" escape="true">
