   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">During the <em style="font: inherit;">six</em>-months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c147083068" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="Share" name="lode:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExpired" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="-3">no</ix:nonFraction> warrants were&#160;expired.&#160;On <em style="font: inherit;"> May 15, 2026, </em>the Company issued a total of <ix:nonFraction id="c147083069" contextRef="d_2026-05-15_2026-05-15_CounterpartyNameAxis-TitanPartnersMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">38,369</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock of the Company for the cashless exercise of <ix:nonFraction id="c147083070" contextRef="d_2026-05-15_2026-05-15_CounterpartyNameAxis-TitanPartnersMember" unitRef="Share" name="lode:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercises" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">214,666</ix:nonFraction> warrants held by an affiliate of Titan Partners.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
